	measure 'Emergency Admissions Variance from ICB' = ```
			
			
			 VAR _CALC = [Emergency Admissions Rate per 1,000 average per year_month] - [Emergency Admissions Rate per 1,000 - ICB average per year_month]
			
			 RETURN FORMAT(_CALC, "+ 0.0;- 0.0")
			```
